$info=sonicwi2,
$bio

Aero Fighters 2 (c) 07/1994 Video System.


Take your pick from 8 funny pilots (among these are an old-fashioned cyborg, a dolphin and a baby just to mention a few!), and blast your way through to reach the mysterious final boss (which changes with each play, a nice touch!) in this vertically shoot'em up game. Features great 2-D graphics (check out the bosses & the explosions!) and the same tried & true gameplay of the first game.


