$bio

Area 88 (c) 08/1989 Capcom.


A horizontally scrolling shoot'em up game.


- TECHNICAL -


Capcom Play System hardware (CPS)

Game ID : CP-S No. 6


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 10 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

