- TIPS AND TRICKS -


* Here's a little known trick that works ONLY on the following end of stage bosses : The 'Flying' Dragons and the 'Walking' Dragons.  Do not try it with the Stone Heads or anything else.  Normally if you come in physical contact with any baddie you will take damage or get poisoned.  That is unless you are in the boss portion of the stage.  When fighting, kneel/crouch down and the boss can't hurt you, in fact they often will walk/fly right past you.  Don't stand up while you are in contact with the boss or you will take damage.  This trick does not work with projectiles and flames emitted from a boss, these you still must avoid!


