Buttons : 4


- TRIVIA -


The game was originally to have areas in which a certain ship form was required to get through them, but the game's production was pushed forward, and it didn't recieve the fine-tuning that was originally planned.


Background space-scapes, pictures of space ships, asteroids and other obstacles are actually digitized pictures of real-life objects. The asteroids were digitised by non other than ILM (Industrial Light and Magic), Lucasart's industry-leading special effects company.


- UPDATES -


