$bio

Circus (c) 01/1977 Exidy.


POP! POP! POP! Pop the balloons and score points. A wall of red, blue and white balloons will appear at the top of the screen. You must pop balloons by catching a clown on the teeter-totter and bouncing him up to the balloons.


