$info=daisenpu,
$bio

Dai Senpuu (c) 1989 Taito.


A vertically scrolling shoot'em up.


- TECHNICAL -


Taito X System hardware

Game ID : B87


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 8 Mhz), Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YM2151 (@ 4 Mhz)


