Main CPU : 68000 (@ 11.8 Mhz), Z80 (@ 8 Mhz)

Sound Chips : QSound (@ 4 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Horizontal

Video resolution : 384 x 224 pixels

Aspect Ratio : 4/3

Screen refresh : 59.63 Hz

Colors palette : 4096


Players : 2

Control : 8-way joystick

Buttons : 2


- TRIVIA -


Giga Wing is the first game to show scores in the trillions!


Note : There are 10 different endings!


SME released a limited-edition soundtrack album for this game (GigaWing Original Soundtrack - CPCA-1026) on 21/04/1999.


