This game is based on the Cuban revolutionary war against the Bautistas that occured in the 1950's. The first player controls Ché Guevara and the second player controls Fidel Castro, current Cuban dictator. The storyline was changed completely for the US version, because Fidel Castro of Cuba and the United States are bitter enemies, and out of respect for the Cuban Missile Crisis.


