$info=hyprolym,hyprolyb,
$bio

Hyper Olympic (c) 10/1983 Konami.


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID : GX361


Main CPU : M6809 (@ 2.048 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 3.579545 Mhz)

Sound Chips : DAC (@ 3.579545 Mhz), SN76496 (@ 1.789772 Mhz), VLM5030 (@ 3.58 Mhz)


