Players : 3

Control : 8-way joystick

Buttons : 2


- TRIVIA -


Pony Canyon / Scitron released a limited-edition soundtrack album for this game (Captain Commando : G.S.M. Capcom 5 - PCCB-00083) on 21/03/1992.


- UPDATES -


A list of features found only in the Japanese (08/1991) and US version (09/1991) :

* An attack for the Hydra where any of the heads jerk backwards and spit a fast glob at a sharp angle.

* A different sound effect is used when a character gains a level, enters a stage or is revived.

* A gold gauntlet treasure worth 800 EXP.

* A green lizard spearman and dark red lizard swordsman.

* A standing triple fireball attack for the Green Dragon.

* More difficult (more enemies).

* Not all fruit restores 16 health.

* The characters gain max HP at different levels.

* The first extra live is at 200k points instead of 100k.

* The order you get upgrades is reversed (armor followed by weaponry).


- STAFF -


Staff : Chin, Tomoshi, Tolaya, Gyo, Shimopi, HK, Yama, Mikiman, Miyao, Iwai, SSS, Mizuho, Hayashi, Manbou, Guych, Dany, Blbon, Ogachy, Hirabe, Wakio


- PORTS -


