$info=lethalen,lethalej,
$bio

Lethal Enforcers (c) 1992 Konami.


As an undercover police officer, your mission is to put a stop to an array of criminals ranging from bank robbers to hijackers to various other undesirables. while upholding the law, you must try to protect the innocent as well by not shooting them. in some occassions, you'll get a chance to upgrade your weapons which include the .357 Magnum, a shotgun, an automatic pistol, an M-16 assault rifle, an 9mm Uzi Sub-Machine Gun, and finally a grenade launcher. while some weapons can be reloaded, some can't be reloaded at all. either way, these weapons can make things easier, but be careful though, if you get shot by any criminal, you'll go back to your standard-issue revolver.


- TECHNICAL -


