$info=loffire,loffirej,
$bio

Line of Fire (c) 1989 Sega.


While on a mission to find the enemy army's secret weapon which happens to be a powerful high caliber machine gun. you end up getting captured by the enemy. Luckily for you, the secret weapon is in your hands. so rather than accept defeat, you decide that the only way to escape the enemy's grasp alive is to waste the enemy with the super machine gun. The way you play the game depends on which cabinet you're playing in (see 'Trivia' for details).


- TECHNICAL -


