$info=lostwrld,
$bio

Lost Worlds (c) 07/1988 Capcom.


In the future, a powerful enemy force has seized an inhabited planet now known as the Dust World and it is up to two unknown soldiers to try to obliterate the invaders and restore their planet's former name : 'Earth'. Features excellent graphics with awesome enemy designs, LOTS of weapons to buy and a solid challenge!


- TECHNICAL -


