An absolutely superb arcade golf game in which one or two players chose from a selection of eight different golfers, each possessing different strengths and weaknesses. Four eighteen-hole golf courses are available: Germany, Japan, Australia and U.S.A. The two games modes on offer are one-player stroke play against the CPU, or stroke or match-play against a second player.


