$bio

New Rally X (c) 02/1981 Namco.


In New Rally-X you drive a car around a maze picking up flags. This is sort of like "Pac-Man", but it differs in the fact that the maze is huge, and there are only a few flags. Your opponents consist of other cars that try to ram into you (beware, as they are slightly faster than you are).


