Programmers : Knight Rider Giu, Senor, Pon, Ittetsu, Hyper Shinchan, Minomiya, Cham Cho Choy, Hard.Yas (- Enemy -), Team Dirty Beret

Game designers : Spp Iorya, Muraski Umagoyashi, Burns Fuji, Ohashi Mamoru, Team Sadogatake

Producer : Takashi Sado

