$info=puyopuyo,puyopuya,puyopuyb,
$bio

Puyo Puyo (c) 10/1992 Sega / Compile.


- TECHNICAL -


Sega System C2 hardware


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 7.670442 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YM2612 (@ 7.670442 Mhz), SN76496 (@ 3.57954 Mhz), uPD7759 (@ 640 Khz)


