$info=radr,radru,
$bio

Rad Rally (c) 1991 Sega.


An update of Sega's "Rad Mobile", Rad Rally offered a choice of four different courses (Sunset, Rain, Night and Mountain). A fully working rear view mirror was introduced and arcade operators were also given the option of a link-up cabinet for two-player, head-to-head racing.


- TECHNICAL -


Sega System 32 hardware


