$info=savgbees,
$bio

Savage Bees (c) 02/1985 Capcom.


An early vertically scrolling shoot'em up.


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 3 Mhz)

Sound Chips : (2x) AY-3-8910 (@ 1.5 Mhz), (2x) SN76496 (@ 3 Mhz)


