$info=shocktro,shocktra,
$bio

Shock Troopers (c) 11/1997 Saurus.


An ambitious terrorist leader holds a girl hostage in order to force her grandfather to surrender a powerful drug in order to fully control the minds of his soldiers & create an ustoppable army. Only a group of 8 soldiers will stand a chance against this rising threat and they will have to face hordes of enemies in order to rescue the girl. Features two gameplay modes (lone wolf & team battle), 8 different characters to choose from, selectable stages, lots of weapons and a high challenge.


- TECHNICAL -


