$info=shocktr2,
$bio

Shock Troopers - 2nd Squad (c) 10/1998 Saurus.


The peace at the newly founded nation of Billberk is coming to an abrupt end. A powerful weapons developer corporation known as DIO has demanded the absolute control of Billberk or it will launch a powerful missile that now holds the entire world hostage! Only a group of 4 anti-terrorist operatives can destroy DIO corporation ambitions and save the world. Features improved graphics with lots of prerendered sprites, awesome sound & music, upgradeable main weapons, many cool vehicles & lots of blood.


