$info=slikshot,sliksh17,
$bio

Slick Shot (c) 04/1990 Grand Products / Incredible Technologies.


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : (2x) M6809 (@ 2 Mhz), Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

Sound Chips : MSM6295 (@ 7.812 Khz), YM2203 (@ 4 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Vertical

