One of the rarest Capcom games, only 150 pcbs were ever made. Capcom released this game in 1995. It didn't sell well and was left as a prototype. Strangely enough, Capcom decided to license the System 32 hardware from Sega for this game. This is the only known non-Sega game to use this hardware.

