Nintendo Famicom (1991)

Sega Mega Drive (1993)

Nintendo Game Boy ("Snow Bros. Jr.") : includes 10 additional (new) levels after you complete all 50 from the arcade.


* Computers :

Amstrad CPC (1991)

$end

