$info=stargld2,
$bio

Star Gladiator 2 - Nightmare of Bilstein (c) 03/1998 Capcom.


- TECHNICAL -


Sony ZN-2 hardware


Main CPU : PSX (@ 16.9344 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 8 Mhz)

