Street Fighter EX2 (c) 03/1998 Arika / Capcom.


- TECHNICAL -


Sony ZN-2 hardware


Main CPU : PSX (@ 16.9344 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 8 Mhz)

Sound Chips : PSX (@ 8 Mhz), QSound (@ 4 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Horizontal

Video resolution : 640 x 480 pixels

Aspect Ratio : 4/3

Screen refresh : 60.00 Hz

