$info=sgemf,sgemfa,sgemfh,
$bio

Super Gem Fighter - Mini Mix (c) 09/1997 Capcom.


- TECHNICAL -


Capcom Play System II hardware (CPS II)

Game ID : CP-S II No. 25


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 11.8 Mhz), Z80 (@ 8 Mhz)

