Tekken 3 (c) 1996 Namco.


World's 19 toughest fighters enter The King Of Iron Fist 3, in order to defeat the evil Heihachi and the two bosses Ogre and True Ogre (True Ogre wasn't 'True Ogre' until the Sony PlayStation release of this game). Every character has his own ambition of winning the tournament. A fully 3D game with one on one concept of fight.


- TECHNICAL -


