Total Carnage is billed as the sequel to "Smash T.V.", mostly because of the dual-joystick controls and massive amounts of enemies onscreen. The concept of Total Carnage is a parody on the 1991 Gulf War. The main bad guy, General Akhboob, is a parody of Saddam Hussein. During scenes with him, he will say slogans from "Smash T.V." as well as things alluding to the Gulf War such as 'All we are making is baby milk!'.


- UPDATES -


* Rev 1.0

* Rev LA1


- TIPS AND TRICKS -


