$info=todruaga,todruago,
$bio

The Tower of Druaga (c) 06/1984 Namco.


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID: TD


Main CPU : 6809 (@ 1.536 Mhz)

Sound CPU : 6809 (@ 1.536 Mhz)

