$info=vendetta,vendetao,vendet2p,vendetas,vendtaso,
$bio

Vendetta (c) 07/1991 Konami.


The four Cobras go after the rival gang that kidnapped their girl. Worth playing to experience the biker lads alone :)


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID : GX081


Main CPU : KONAMI (@ 3 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YM2151 (@ 4 Mhz), 053260 (@ 4 Mhz)


